<main class="container-xxl">
    <div id="organizations-block" class="my-3 p-3 rounded shadow">
        <h6 class="border-bottom pb-2 mb-3">Organizations</h6>

        {{#unless page_data.scim_enabled}}
        <div class="alert alert-secondary small" role="alert">
            <strong>SCIM provisioning is disabled.</strong>
            Set <code>SCIM_ENABLED=true</code> to let an identity provider such as Microsoft Entra ID provision members
            and groups. Tokens can only be generated while it is enabled.
        </div>
        {{else}}
        {{#unless page_data.org_groups_enabled}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning small" role="alert">
            <strong>Groups are disabled.</strong>
            SCIM group provisioning needs <code>ORG_GROUPS_ENABLED=true</code>; the <code>/Groups</code> endpoints
            return <code>501 Not Implemented</code> until it is set. User provisioning works either way.
        </div>
        {{/unless}}
        {{#unless page_data.org_events_enabled}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning small" role="alert">
            <strong>Organization event logging is disabled.</strong>
            SCIM changes members without anyone watching; set <code>ORG_EVENTS_ENABLED=true</code> to record what it
            does in the organization event log.
        </div>
        {{/unless}}
        {{/unless}}

        <div class="table-responsive-xl small">
            <table id="orgs-table" class="table table-sm table-striped table-hover">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="vw-org-details">Organization</th>
                        <th class="vw-users">Users</th>
                        <th class="vw-entries">Entries</th>
                        <th class="vw-attachments">Attachments</th>
                        <th class="vw-misc">Misc</th>
                        <th class="vw-scim">SCIM</th>
                        <th class="vw-actions">Actions</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each page_data.organizations}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            <svg width="48" height="48" class="float-start me-2 rounded" data-jdenticon-value="{{id}}">
                            <div class="float-start">
                                <strong>{{name}}</strong>
                                <span class="me-2">({{billingEmail}})</span>
                                <span class="d-block">
                                    <span class="badge bg-success font-monospace">{{id}}</span>
                                </span>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="d-block">{{user_count}}</span>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="d-block">{{cipher_count}}</span>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Amount:</strong> {{attachment_count}}</span>
                            {{#if attachment_count}}
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Size:</strong> {{attachment_size}}</span>
                            {{/if}}
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Collections:</strong> {{collection_count}}</span>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Groups:</strong> {{group_count}}</span>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Events:</strong> {{event_count}}</span>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#unless ../page_data.scim_enabled}}
                            <span class="d-block text-muted">Disabled server-wide</span>
                            {{else}}
                            {{#if scim_configured}}
                            <span class="d-block"><span class="badge bg-success">Token active</span></span>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Created:</strong> {{scim_created_at}}</span>
                            <span class="d-block"><strong>Last used:</strong> {{scim_last_used_at}}</span>
                            {{else}}
                            <span class="d-block"><span class="badge bg-secondary">No token</span></span>
                            {{/if}}
                            <span class="d-block mt-1">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link p-0 border-0"
                                    vw-scim-rotate
                                    data-vw-org-uuid="{{id}}"
                                    data-vw-org-name="{{name}}"
                                    data-vw-scim-configured="{{scim_configured}}">{{#if scim_configured}}Rotate token{{else}}Generate token{{/if}}</button>
                            </span>
                            {{#if scim_configured}}
                            <span class="d-block">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link p-0 border-0 text-danger"
                                    vw-scim-revoke
                                    data-vw-org-uuid="{{id}}"
                                    data-vw-org-name="{{name}}">Revoke token</button>
                            </span>
                            <span class="d-block">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link p-0 border-0"
                                    vw-scim-endpoint
                                    data-vw-org-uuid="{{id}}"
                                    data-vw-org-name="{{name}}"
                                    data-vw-scim-endpoint="{{scim_endpoint}}">Show endpoint</button>
                            </span>
                            {{/if}}
                            {{/unless}}
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-end px-1 small">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-link p-0 border-0 float-right" vw-delete-organization data-vw-org-uuid="{{id}}" data-vw-org-name="{{name}}" data-vw-billing-email="{{billingEmail}}">Delete Organization</button><br>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3 clearfix">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary float-end" id="reload">Reload organizations</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<div class="modal fade" id="scimModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="scimModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title" id="scimModalLabel">SCIM configuration</h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body small">
                <p class="mb-2">Organization <strong id="scimModalOrgName"></strong></p>

                <div id="scimTokenBlock" class="d-none">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
                        <strong>Copy this token now.</strong> It is stored only as a hash and cannot be shown again.
                        Generating a new one immediately invalidates the previous token.
                    </div>
                    <label class="form-label" for="scimTokenValue">Bearer token</label>
                    <div class="input-group mb-3">
                        <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="scimTokenValue" readonly>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-vw-copy-target="scimTokenValue">Copy</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <label class="form-label" for="scimEndpointValue">Tenant URL / SCIM endpoint</label>
                <div class="input-group mb-3">
                    <input type="text" class="form-control font-monospace" id="scimEndpointValue" readonly>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" data-vw-copy-target="scimEndpointValue">Copy</button>
                </div>

                <h6 class="border-bottom pb-2 mb-2">Microsoft Entra ID setup</h6>
                <ol class="mb-3">
                    <li>In the Entra admin center, open your enterprise application and go to <em>Provisioning</em>.</li>
                    <li>Set <em>Provisioning Mode</em> to <strong>Automatic</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Paste the endpoint above into <strong>Tenant URL</strong> and the token into <strong>Secret Token</strong>.</li>
                    <li>Choose <em>Test Connection</em>, then save and start provisioning.</li>
                </ol>

                <h6 class="border-bottom pb-2 mb-2">What SCIM can and cannot do</h6>
                <ul class="mb-0">
                    <li>Provisioned members are <strong>invited</strong>, never auto-confirmed. An organization admin still confirms them.</li>
                    <li>SCIM only manages members with the ordinary <strong>User</strong> role. Owners, Admins and Managers are read-only through SCIM.</li>
                    <li><code>active: false</code> revokes organization access and keeps the membership; <code>DELETE</code> removes the membership but never the Vaultwarden account.</li>
                    <li>An account's email address is never changed by SCIM. Deprovision and reprovision to move someone to a new address.</li>
                    <li>Full documentation: <code>docs/scim/README.md</code>.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Done</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{urlpath}}/vw_static/datatables.css" />
<script src="{{urlpath}}/vw_static/jquery-4.0.0.slim.js"></script>
<script src="{{urlpath}}/vw_static/datatables.js"></script>
<script src="{{urlpath}}/vw_static/admin_organizations.js"></script>
<script src="{{urlpath}}/vw_static/jdenticon-3.3.0.js"></script>
